   "titulo": "Turn around.",
   "texto": [
    "To say that something changes and becomes otherwise is used **-아/어지다** after an adjective: hhhhh → **추워지다** (get cold), hhh → **좋아지다** (improve), hhhh → **예뻐지다** (get pretty), hhh → **커지다** (grow).",
    "날씨가 **추워졌어요** = el tiempo se ha vuelto frío."
   ]
